00:00:12.934 --> 00:00:15.834
-We do this thing every week
where I send out a hashtag

00:00:15.834 --> 00:00:18.000
and I ask you guys
to respond to that topic.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.467
So, since it's
St. Patrick's Day

00:00:19.467 --> 00:00:21.033
and we all want
to go out and party

00:00:21.033 --> 00:00:22.701
but we have to wait
a few more months,

00:00:22.701 --> 00:00:24.334
I thought we could reminisce.

00:00:24.334 --> 00:00:26.467
So I sent out the hashtag
#PartyFail,

00:00:26.467 --> 00:00:28.100
where I asked you guys
to tweet out

00:00:28.100 --> 00:00:30.167
some of your best party stories.

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.000
Within minutes,
it was a trending topic,

00:00:32.000 --> 00:00:33.667
so thank you for playing along.

00:00:33.667 --> 00:00:36.133
And now I thought I'd share
some of my favorite

00:00:36.133 --> 00:00:38.667
#PartyFail responses
from you guys.

00:00:38.667 --> 00:00:42.767
